WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.140
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.570
Chris!

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:43.310
Episode 26

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:43.310
Birth! Super Sonic

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:55.630
Cream, do you like me?

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:57.340
Of course.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.640
I really like you.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.760
You don't sound like her at all!

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:08.690
It's Dr. Eggman!

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:20.740
It flew away.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.950
It's gone.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.870
What was that about?

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.750
Sonic?

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.000
Chris!

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:35.050
Oh no! He's chasing us as fast as he can.

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:36.170
Sonic!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.670
Dr. Eggman, what shall we do?

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:43.800
Let him be. Getting the seventh Chaos Emerald is more important.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:45.680
Understood!

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:53.690
Dr. Eggman is heading south through Station Square.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:56.780
Are the citizens being evacuated?

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:04.950
Yes. We don't know where Dr. Eggman is headed, but we've sent evacuation notices to everyone in the southern area.

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:11.500
Ever since their arrival, we've become prepared for these types of situations.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:12.880
Mr. President.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:17.050
The Beetle from GUN has arrived on scene.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:20.010
They can begin operations at any time.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:28.810
Okay. The only question is how large Chaos Control's effect will be.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.150
Only God knows.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.440
That's irresponsible of us.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:47.330
GUN is moving south, Tails! S105 course 237.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.620
Okay!

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.960
Topaz, this is beautiful.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.050
I guess so.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:00.970
I can really have this?

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:07.510
You better like it. The sales clerk guaranteed that you would.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:09.100
No wonder it's nice.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.520
What!

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.520
Thank you.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:21.070
But in exchange, promise me that you won't say goodbye.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:32.960
I'm sorry, Chris. It's all my fault.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:45.550
Well done! E-77, you're much better than those useless mechas!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.800
What do you think he meant?

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.600
I think we should take his words literally.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.730
Did I say something to offend you?

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:57.900
E-77, come home. Welcome.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.950
Things won't go as planned!

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:08.990
Oh no! The Chaos Emerald - I mean - E-77 was...

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.280
Serves you right!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.200
It's in trouble!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:18.670
That's E-77. It's full of luck.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:21.590
I'm not going to let you have this Chaos Emerald.

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:22.920
Sonic!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:29.760
He's always getting in my way! E-77, don't let him have the Chaos Emerald!

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.260
Why are you giving it to him?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.560
He's obedient.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.310
Sonic is going to take it!

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:40.440
That was fast of you.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.820
I didn't know you already had this mecha ready.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:45.400
What's that mecha? Did you build it?

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.610
We don't have the skills to do that.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.070
That's what I thought.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.990
Where did those mechas come from?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.750
Beetle 1 to Beetle 3, we've arrived at our positions.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.420
Roger. No. 1 external speaker.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:04.630
This is GUN's special attack team Super Beetle.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:10.470
We will begin attacking Eggman's ship. Get to safe distance immediately.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.220
But I guess in your case, there's nothing to worry about.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:15.930
Wait a second! Chris is being held hostage inside!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.770
Begin the attack!

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.650
Those punks!

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:31.740
I said wait! Chris is still inside!

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.210
Chris!

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.260
That actually made me nervous.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:56.390
If we didn't turn on the barrier in time, we would have been destroyed.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:59.350
That's why we should've had the barrier on from the beginning.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:03.650
Shut up! We don't need the barrier to fight against those weaklings!

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:08.030
Well, that's what I first thought. But it seems they're capable of making something decent.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:10.200
Hey, look at this!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.160
At what?

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.870
It's the interior of their mecha.

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:17.330
That's your mecha design, Dr. Eggman.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:26.250
What? How dare they steal my idea! I worked hard to build it, and they're using it without my permission!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.550
Open all gun ports! I'll destroy them along with Sonic!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.640
But E-77 is still on the ground.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:38.060
It'll be fine. With its luck, it probably won't get hit.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:40.310
You're being irresponsible.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.890
Fire!

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:53.780
Stop acting crazy!

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:58.120
Here goes a big one. Fire Egg Beam Cannon Ball!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:14.390
Did you see how powerful that was?

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.390
Wasn't that a bit overboard?

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.430
At this rate, you will destroy the entire planet.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:25.060
Don't worry. If that happens, I'll build a new planet.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.690
I see.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.650
That voice is...

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.240
It's E-77!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:35.610
I told you it was lucky.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:36.240
Huh?

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:39.370
What the-? They're not destroyed either!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:43.750
That's why they're using the mechas that you created, Dr. Eggman.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.630
Wow. I'm mesmerized by my own talent.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.670
If we continue the pattern...

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.670
Sonic!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.220
As expected.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:56.640
This is why I hate anime. He would normally be dead.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.220
Anime are great.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:02.730
We have to be careful. What if children watch this show and copy our actions?

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.270
They can't copy firing missiles and laser beams.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.600
These days, you never know.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:13.190
Anyway, our priority is to get E-77's Chaos Emerald!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.490
Roger!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:23.040
They're going after the Chaos Emerald. I won't let them!

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.160
Egg Fort has begun moving.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.870
Pursue them immediately.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:31.250
Beetle, change to high speed mode!

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.890
How far is it going to fly?

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:44.600
It can fly really well.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.020
Maybe it's flying on its own.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:49.610
I won't let you have the Chaos Emerald!

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.690
Quiet, you brat!

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:59.030
It's no big deal. Without the X-Tornado, Sonic can't catch up to us.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:01.830
Thanks!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.420
Wow! Nice jump!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.250
That's cheating!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:17.800
Oh my.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.220
Sonic!

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:20.220
How?

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:23.510
Oh no! He's going to catch E-77!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.980
You just realized that now?

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.360
There we go.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:37.740
Calm down. I won't hurt you, so don't worry.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:43.280
But that Chaos Emerald is very important. Will you give it to me?

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.670
It's in love.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:55.710
Don't be ridiculous! Take a good look below.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:11:03.430
Sonic will splash into the ocean. In other words, E-77's luck is always on our side.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:06.970
You can fly? How lucky for me!

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.850
That's the power of love.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:12.150
Lucky betrayed us, so that means we're unlucky.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:18.530
I won't forgive it! Decoe, Bocoe! Get into position! I'll show them the real strength of Egg Fort II!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:21.740
Real strength? Do you mean...

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.320
You're finally going to use it?

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:31.920
That's right. Egg Fort II will transform and then combine into the strongest robot in history!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:38.920
If you miss this part, you won't know what everyone will be talking about at school tomorrow. So don't change the channel!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:52.310
Sorry to keep you waiting! Change Egg Fort!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.020
Set on!

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:58.530
Bang, combo mode!

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.150
Babang, combo mode!

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:04.450
Bababang, combo mode!

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:28.510
Surprised? Egg Fort II transformed into its ultimate Eggman robot form: E-99.

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:31.600
There was a time when that robot design was considered cool.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:42.780
Hey! You deliberately stepped into the ocean!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:47.450
Do you really think that you can keep up with my speed in that gigantic frame?

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.080
Come on! Come on!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:55.500
Hey brat, I'll show you something interesting.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:58.040
Do you know what these are?

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.840
They're Chaos Emeralds!

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:09.720
That's right. Let's see what happens when I embed them one-by-one into E-99.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:22.530
E-99 can see you, Sonic.

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:27.910
It's my fault. It's all my fault.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.290
Sonic!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.630
Sonic!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:45.170
This is incredible.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.300
It's pretty tough.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:54.470
Of course. Don't underestimate the power of six Chaos Emeralds.

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:57.060
Please stop, Eggman!

00:13:57.060 --> 00:14:00.900
You know I can't. Or else, we have no TV show.

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:04.530
Damn!

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.820
Sonic!

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.120
Tails, hurry up and give him the ring!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:16.580
If I had at least one Chaos Emerald, I could make one. However, X-Tornado can't right now.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:21.710
You don't have any? Then fine! Let me off so that I can pummel it!

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.460
That's too dangerous!

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:28.220
Target Eggman's robot! All ships attack!

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:29.680
It disappeared!

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:41.190
All the Beetles have been wiped out.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:44.070
Dr. Eggman, how powerful.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.570
It's frightening.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.570
It's the product of my genius.

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:48.820
Eggman!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.990
I'm just getting started.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:59.000
I'm going to get Chris back!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.210
Oh my, Sonic is all beaten up.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:06.050
He's fired up. It's not like him.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:10.590
Sonic, give up already. I don't want to continue fighting either.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:11.550
Attack me!

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:14.260
Now don't say that.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:20.560
E-99, you don't have to try so hard anymore. Take it easy on him.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.570
Sonic!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.120
Can't you do something?

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.450
No, I can't get any closer!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:44.080
With that many Chaos Emeralds gathered together, nothing can be done.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.630
Damn!

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.970
Sonic!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.930
Sonic!

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:02.100
E-99, that's enough. Just throw Sonic away.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.850
That's what you should do.

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:47.900
What?

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:52.110
You idiot!

00:16:56.660 --> 00:17:01.620
I will not let you have it.

00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:09.100
<b>La la la...</b>

00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:09.100
<i>La la la...</i>

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:11.050
I will not let anyone have it. They're mine. Only me. Sonic...

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:20.960
<b>La la la...</b>

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:20.960
<i>La la la...</i>

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:17.260
Sonic, you're staying with me forever.

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:28.270
I don't know if he's stupid or reckless. If Decoe was late in turning off the main power, he might have died.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:28.780
<b>Owaru hazu no nai ai ga todaeta</b>

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:28.780
<i>The love that should have no end stopped</i>

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.690
You noticed?

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:33.900
<b>inochi tsukite yuku you ni</b>

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:33.900
<i>So we are going to finish our life together</i>

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:33.780
Its power is unbelievable.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:40.990
Wait a second. If we cut the power between E-99 and the Chaos Emeralds...

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:38.690
<b>Chigau kitto chigau</b>

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:38.690
<i>It's a mistake, surely a mistake</i>

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:45.980
<b>kokoro ga sakenderu</b>

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:45.980
<i>my heart is screaming</i>

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:42.200
What did you say?

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.790
Why now?

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:51.300
<b>Hitori de wa ikite yukenakute</b>

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:51.300
<i>We can't go live alone and then</i>

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:51.590
Eggman, give Chris back.

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:56.090
<b>Mata dareka wo aishite iru</b>

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:56.090
<i>Love someone else again,</i>

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:56.380
Are you trying to act cool? You were the one who was easily tricked in the first place.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.260
He's angry.

00:17:57.140 --> 00:18:06.750
<b>Kokoro kanashikute kotoba ni dekinai</b>

00:17:57.140 --> 00:18:06.750
<i>My heart is so sad, words cannot describe.</i>

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.260
He's still mad about that.

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:04.560
I'm taking him with me. Sorry for the intrusion.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:09.060
Chris? What did you do with Chris?

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:19.390
<b>La la la...</b>

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:19.390
<i>La la la...</i>

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:15.940
Now all these Chaos Emeralds belong to me.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:23.790
Please... Please take me to Sonic.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:31.150
<b>La la la... Kotoba ni dekinai</b>

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:31.150
<i>La la la... words cannot describe</i>

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:26.620
That's enough. I went through a lot of trouble to acquire them.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.250
Sonic!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.960
Stop squirming!

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:35.380
Oh no! The Chaos Emeralds!

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:38.030
<b>Setsunai uso wo tsuite wa</b>

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:38.030
<i>The painful lies we're telling</i>

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:42.980
<b>iiwake wo nomikonde</b>

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:42.980
<i>The excuses we're swallowing</i>

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:44.850
Look at what you did.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:48.820
<b>Hatasenu ano koro no</b>

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:48.820
<i>They don't achieve anything</i>

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:49.980
This isn't my fault anymore.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:55.650
<b>yume wa mou kieta</b>

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:55.650
<i>the dream of that time already vanished</i>

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:54.610
The kid destroyed this, and you destroyed that section, Knuckles.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:57.690
Which means we can no longer control E-99.

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:59.970
<b>Dare no sei demo nai</b>

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:59.970
<i>It's no one's fault</i>

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:59.450
That's bad.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.200
So it's my fault.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:02.820
This isn't funny at all.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:06.050
<b>Jibun ga chiisa sugiru kara</b>

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:06.050
<i>It's because I'm too small myself</i>

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.200
Chris!

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:16.650
<b>Sore ga kuyashikute kotoba ni dekinai</b>

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:16.650
<i>That's what I'm regretting, words cannot describe</i>

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.830
What's that?

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.710
It's Sonic!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.430
Why is he glowing gold?

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:29.160
<b>La la la...</b>

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:29.160
<i>La la la...</i>

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:31.020
Wow! E-99's super-strong alloy has been shattered to pieces.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:41.140
<b>La la la... Kotoba ni dekinai</b>

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:41.140
<i>La la la... words cannot describe</i>

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.360
Dr. Eggman, what now?

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:44.240
Don't fret. Sonic had the last Chaos Emerald, and it merged with the six Chaos Emeralds that fell into the ocean to become one.

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:46.450
Dr. Eggman, you look subdued.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:49.700
What's wrong? Are you hurt?

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:52.830
Chaos Control will begin.

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:09.640
<b>Mou...  Ima...</b>

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:09.640
<i>No longer...  Now...</i>

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:13.480
Knuckles, can you hear me? I'm going to destroy this robot. Stay safely away.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:30.830
This is Chaos Control.

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:39.240
<b>Anata ni aete hontou ni yokatta</b>

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:39.240
<i>When I met you, it was truly good.</i>

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.000
This is bad! You'll also be caught alongside us!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.670
Don't worry about me. I don't care!

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:50.290
<b>Ureshikute ureshikute kotoba ni dekinai</b>

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:50.290
<i>So happy, so happy, words cannot describe.</i>

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:44.470
It's the light that Chris was talking about.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:48.600
Sonic... Is he going home?

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.220
It can't be...

00:20:50.290 --> 00:21:02.230
<b>La la la...</b>

00:20:50.290 --> 00:21:02.230
<i>La la la...</i>

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:12.280
<b>La la la... Kotoba ni dekinai</b>

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:12.280
<i>La la la... words cannot describe</i>

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:05.070
Chris...

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:07.990
Chris.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:20.210
Thank you, Chris. You saved me.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:28.720
Sonic? Take me with you.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:32.890
Sonic, I don't want us to be apart.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:41.950
<b>Anata ni aete...</b>

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:41.950
<i>To have met you...</i>

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:43.990
Sonic!

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:47.860
Chris, even if I'm not around anymore...

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:54.450
No! I can't do anything without you, Sonic!

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:58.640
<b>Kotoba ni dekinai</b>

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:58.640
<i>words cannot describe</i>

00:21:55.750 --> 00:22:00.460
It's true! If I'm alone, I'll...

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:04.710
<b>Ima anata ni aete...</b>

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:04.710
<i>To have met you now...</i>

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:02.950
<b></b>

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.640
Chris...

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:14.560
Thank you.

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:26.360
Sonic!

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:52.010
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:52.010
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:23:00.980
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:23:00.980
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:10.050
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:10.050
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:19.640
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:19.640
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:28.820
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:28.820
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:28.820 --> 00:23:38.580
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:28.820 --> 00:23:38.580
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:39.540 --> 00:23:48.300
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:39.540 --> 00:23:48.300
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:46.280 --> 00:23:48.280
What's going on?

00:23:48.300 --> 00:23:56.530
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:48.300 --> 00:23:56.530
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:52.700
We're still confirming, but there are two large islands.

00:23:53.750 --> 00:23:56.010
They're probably from Sonic's world.

00:23:57.310 --> 00:24:00.770
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:57.310 --> 00:24:00.770
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:03.330
Hi there again.

00:24:30.590 --> 00:25:35.260
The Beginning of the Disaster
